":"false"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"true"},{"key":"revision_round","html":"2026-10-16"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{MLRandom}\">\\(\\mathrm{MLRandom}\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\equiv_K\">\\(\\equiv_K\\)</span> 分别见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"0586e0fd0301d605\" href=\"?note=0586e0fd0301d605\" title=\"43-df-mlrandom\">43-df-mlrandom</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"9d68ed64bfec741d\" href=\"?note=9d68ed64bfec741d\" title=\"43-df-complexity-red\">43-df-complexity-red</a>。商集的底集由下式显式给出。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal R\\coloneqq\\{X\\in2^\\omega:\\mathrm{MLRandom}(X)\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathcal R\\coloneqq\\{X\\in2^\\omega:\\mathrm{MLRandom}(X)\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\left|\\mathcal R/{\\equiv_K}\\right|=2^{\\aleph_0}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\left|\\mathcal R/{\\equiv_K}\\right|=2^{\\aleph_0}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>这是度的数量，不是单个度的大小。原稿随后用于说明的Theorem 14.4.15缺少必要假设且未填完关系E，本条只核对14.4.14的陈述，不把该未完成证明标成已核验。</p>\n<p>来源：用户提供的2007-07-28草稿，Theorem 14.4.14; printed p.400 / PDF p.420。本轮逐项比对来源陈述并人工核对类型、参数和去Remark条件；未声称机器形式验证或来源完整证明核验。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"43-df-complexity-red","status":"resolved","id":"9d68ed64bfec741d","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-complexity-red]]",